{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Department for Work and Pensions ","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF STRATEGIC COMMUNICATIONS) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 14 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 45 – February 2018 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 45; the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":39,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":44,"tree_line_start":40},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer.  ","tree_line_end":50,"tree_line_start":45},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":55,"tree_line_start":51},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":60,"tree_line_start":56},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":65,"tree_line_start":61},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":77,"tree_line_start":66},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":82,"tree_line_start":78},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":83},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n ","tree_line_end":102,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":107,"tree_line_start":103},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/Long Edge in order to produce double sided prints. ","tree_line_end":112,"tree_line_start":108},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":117,"tree_line_start":113},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"3. Amendment 45 affects the abbreviations, chapters 83, 84, 85 & 86. The changes: ","tree_line_end":123,"tree_line_start":118},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":124},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"• Chapter 83 - incorporate DMG memo 12/15. \n• Chapter 84 - incorporate DMG Memos 14/17 & 20/17. \n• Chapter 85 - add to the list of exclusions at 85095; incorporate DMG Memos 12/15, 20/17, 22/17 and 23/17 including a re-drafting of paragraphs. \n• Chapter 86 - make minor legal reference amendments to 86210 & 86211; include a note regarding ‘holiday lets’ at 86591.  ","tree_line_end":152,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 83 - incorporate DMG memo 12/15. ","tree_line_end":134,"tree_line_start":129},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 84 - incorporate DMG Memos 14/17 & 20/17. ","tree_line_end":140,"tree_line_start":135},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 85 - add to the list of exclusions at 85095; incorporate DMG Memos 12/15, 20/17, 22/17 and 23/17 including a re-drafting of paragraphs. ","tree_line_end":146,"tree_line_start":141},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 86 - make minor legal reference amendments to 86210 & 86211; include a note regarding ‘holiday lets’ at 86591.  ","tree_line_end":152,"tree_line_start":147},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":156,"tree_line_start":153},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"4. If using a PDF amendment package 